==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{label|en|pathology}} A [[chronic]] [[disease]] caused by [[compulsive]] and uncontrollable consumption of [[alcohol]]ic [[beverage]]s, leading to [[addiction]] and deterioration in health and social functioning.
# {{label|en|pathology}} Acute alcohol poisoning.

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|alcoholic}}
* {{l|en|dipsomania}}, {{l|en|dipsomaniac}}
* {{l|en|-holism}}

